Bind Npc 24431 Zone 1
Quest 473 "[Repeatable Solo] Uruk Blade Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Hashan has commissioned you to hunt Uruk Blade. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 30 of 9717, 1693 at direction_551

Requires player level >= 56 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 3750000 with premium

direction_551 = location "Uruk Blade" about "Uruk Blade\nA high-level orc race inhabiting the continent of Adonis; distinguishing trait: strong Attack Power" found "Karus Eslant" at 1699 625 in zone 1

On offer
    Say "Uruk Blades are advancing toward this region after having killed people at the village entrance. I knew orcs were strong and brutal but I never imagine it would be to this extent. Please help me."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_551
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Don't tell me you're planning on facing them alone.\n\nIf you do a favor for [Guard] Hashan, you will be rewarded."

On claimable
    Show quest "I don't know how to thank you. This is compensation for your help. This is all I can give you."
